 "ambiguities": [
  "Rows dropped for null tourney_date/winner_id/loser_id BEFORE computing k (earlier-row counter) in game_id.",
  "Output row order: Elo order, winner row then loser row.",
  "Surface used as raw string in keys (missing/other surface values form their own cell); Elo surface validity separate.",
  "Missing best_of in a non-RET/DEF score -> unusable (ok False); RET/DEF matches do not need best_of. Missing best_of is its own key value.",
  "Round as text for rup uses str() so missing round becomes 'nan'; rtp round group for missing = late.",
  "tbe: tour rate tr is the plain mean of the same column (tb for tbe_tb_rate, straight for tbe_ss_rate) over (tour,best_of) matches in the 1095-day window; ne for tb_rate/ss_rate use their own column weights, tbe_n_eff uses the tb column.",
  "wmc/gmc/ssc/scd/tbe/vsh values use ok matches only (d_w from RET/DEF matches excluded there); rtp/rms use ret matches only.",
  "vsh sums use independent NaN skipping per column; denominators <=0 -> NaN; event n = count(v4) over event window.",
  "psd: exp_ss window excludes same-date matches; player's win list restricted to non-NaN res before taking last 60; ties on date ordered by Elo order.",
  "rup: seed_bin 'one' when exactly one seed numeric; rup_resid = mean*n/(n+100).",
  "Dates mapped to day numbers; window lower bound inclusive (date - window <= d_m).",
  "Elo p computed with float 10**; W/O matches still get pre-ratings recorded but no update; rating tie uses string key compare.",
  "Shrunk values: NaN if pool count 0; cell columns evaluated per column independently.",
  "ssc_n_pre / rup_n_pre / vsh_n_pre / tbe_n_eff_pre are counts (0 when none).",
  "Files read in sorted name order (atp before wta); match_num cast via float to int.",
  "mwc_player_share_pre when last non-empty but no champions: hhi=top2=0.0 (empty sum), share 0.",
  "Edition ties in sort: tourney_id compared as string.",
  "Edition surface/name taken from first G row of the edition; start = date of first G row.",
  "Edition reach: nations with null/non-text ioc skipped; nation absent from reach treated as 0.",
  "Each (tour,date) processed over all matches of that tour (any level), j = first edition with start==date.",
  "s2s: pairs use editions 1..k-1; n_b==0 gives rate 8*pooled/8; non-major matches keep n_pairs=0, bucket/surface NaN, rate NaN.",
  "hsdp: past editions filtered by i<j (sorted index), same host, done<date, then last 15 taken; if past empty frequencies NaN but hsdp_home still set.",
  "hsdp_home 0.0 when nation missing; frequencies NaN when nation missing.",
  "Date arithmetic via calendar dates; done strictly before = done < date.",
  "Duplicate game_ids kept (not deduplicated); row order = read order, winner row then loser row.",
  "Rows with null match_num kept (match_num string 'nan') if any; otherwise match_num cast via int(float()).",
  "Own match need not be OK for its output to be computed; only earlier matches must have non-NaN values.",
  "If ne>0 but tour rate tr is NaN (earlier event matches with different best_of than any other), result is NaN (literal formula).",
  "Window: earlier matches with date_ord in [d-1095, d-1] using calendar day differences from tourney_date.",
  "Tour rate means over OK earlier matches with same (tour,best_of) computed via integer-valued prefix sums (exact); event weights computed pairwise directly.",
  "Player ids cast float->int->string; tourney_name NaN treated as its own event key group.",
  "Rows with usable but 'ABD'/'UNP' only flagged unusable; RET/DEF matches are never OK."
